# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# Frontend (Node / Vite)
node_modules
graphify-out
ui/dist
*.local
.pnpm-store/

# Tauri generated
src-tauri/gen

# Runtime logs and crash output can contain player identities, game IDs, IPs,
# ports, local paths, and authentication diagnostics.
*.log
/logs/
/LOG_DIR_IS_UNDEFINED/
/src-tauri/LOG_DIR_IS_UNDEFINED/

# Local environment and client configuration. Keep documented templates.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!*.env.example
*.prefs
settings.json
settings.local.json
client-settings.json
!settings.example.json
!*.settings.example.json

# Local databases and credential stores.
*.db
*.db-*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.kdbx

# Private keys and certificate bundles.
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p7b
*.p7c

# Crash dumps and diagnostic traces.
#
# The `core` patterns are anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, `core`
# and `core.*` match at *every* level, which silently excluded
# `ui/src/store/reducers/core.ts` from the repository: the working tree built
# fine and every gate passed, while a clean checkout was missing five reducer
# twins and could not compile. Core dumps land in the working directory of the
# process that crashed, so the root is the only place they need covering.
*.dmp
*.dump
*.core
/core
/core.*
*.stackdump
*.crash
*.trace

# FAF anti-smurf binary (downloaded from github.com/FAForever/uid/releases)
/faf-uid
/faf-uid.exe
# FAF's Go ICE adapter, downloaded from github.com/FAForever/faf-pioneer/releases
# by scripts/ensure-faf-pioneer.mjs. The root entries cover the copy this used to
# be committed as, so an old checkout does not offer it back.
/faf-pioneer
/faf-pioneer.exe
/natives/*
!/natives/.gitkeep

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Context
/context

# Agent rules file
AGENTS.md
Agents.md

